  <item>
    <title>06 细细缓缓最是动人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e558c46ea60022352f769e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e558c46ea60022352f769e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2025 14:12:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>为什么花瓣的颜色，潮湿的气息，粉笔灰卡在指甲缝隙的干燥感，三轮车链条的卡壳声，葡萄酸涩的味道，孤独而幸福的感受，有时候是悲伤的心情，都可以在大脑里存活这么久呢？为什么回忆这些时刻的过程里，总有想流泪的冲动呢？</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【封面图】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqsfKnIQd3O3q0qNh0Rjt51dbvhR.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2023春 画于玉渊潭公园</span></p><span></span><p><span>✩︎</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【时间线】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> Part 1 忽見山桃綻放的春夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">00:04:52</a> Part 2 綿爛是為著淡薄仔詩意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">00:05:39</a> 台语词「綿爛」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">00:14:50</a>《小城之春》与Normal people</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">00:25:33</a> 闲暇 创作 阶级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">00:29:46</a> Part 3 水草在溪流裡緩緩擺動</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">00:30:12</a> 人如何学会语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">00:42:21</a> 奥斯维辛的语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">00:48:07</a> 林奕含的“工笔”，王德威分析的抒情传统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3457">00:57:37</a> 结尾 Spring Rain</span></p><span></span><p><span>✩︎</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【书籍/论文/电影】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《使女的故事》玛格丽特·阿特伍德</span></p><span></span><p><span>《樱桃园》契诃夫</span></p><span></span><p><span>《史诗时代的抒情声音》王德威</span></p><span></span><p><span>《苦雨之地》吴明益</span></p><span></span><p><span>《被淹没与被拯救的》普里莫·莱维</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一九八四》乔治·奥威尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>《房思琪的初恋乐园》林奕含</span></p><span></span><p><span>《正常人》萨莉·鲁尼</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小城之春》费穆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《密会》《春夜》安畔锡</span></p><span></span><p><span>《天水围的日与夜》许鞍华</span></p><span></span><p><span>✩︎</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【音乐】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>春天花会开 - 任贤齐</span></p><span></span><p><span>囡仔汗 - 鄭宜農</span></p><span></span><p><span>人如何學會語言 - 鄭宜農</span></p><span></span><p><span>Spring Rain - Oscar Dunbar</span></p><span></span><p><span>✩︎</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【引用】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjoyeT8twkTw774Xnz8Zuv0PYIxt.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouC38NyhI9ZhLSsQ5A793QGG57S.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4Ahx0fYtMMJV4INdlfaHwlvBgc.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsqtBBVuqAF7nwA_OhummiPdTBF9.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuhs54lF-MFy9qM_99iMS6BkH1CL.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FusC05WebGDP0s1oLf0H4D5W__aK.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【支持创作】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>播客文稿/更新消息发布于同名公众号</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/shdVPWsARo5L6AMfid3l9A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/shdVPWsARo5L6AMfid3l9A"><span>「红豆面包」</span></a><span>，欢迎打赏支持</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待你的关注和留言！祝你春天快乐ฅ</span></p>]]></description>
