  <item>
    <title>05 来自尼日利亚的她拥抱着我｜🍞面包小报</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d13821e924d4525a0fc13d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d13821e924d4525a0fc13d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 07:46:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📮[The New Yorker February 17&amp;24, 2025 Fiction] </span><a href="https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2025/02/17/chuka-fiction-chimamanda-ngozi-adichie" data-url="https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2025/02/17/chuka-fiction-chimamanda-ngozi-adichie"><span>CHUKA</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>by </span><a href="https://www.chimamanda.com/" data-url="https://www.chimamanda.com/"><span>Chimamanda Ngozi Adichie</span></a><span> 奇玛曼达·恩戈兹·阿迪契</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7Sj9HNUiuPSsWJ0pB6wfoueQhw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>✩︎</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【时间线】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 关于栏目「🍞面包小报」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">00:03:29</a> 纽约客一百周年这一期刊载的CHUKA（节选自新书Dream Count）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">00:14:01</a> 阅读阿迪契</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">00:17:20</a> 读完阿迪契首部长篇《紫木槿》，想到《善意的竞争》</span></p><span></span><p><span>✩︎</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>【演讲&amp;书籍&amp;影视】</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>TED 2009 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15a4y1E7wi/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15a4y1E7wi/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>单一故事的危险性</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>TED 2013 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13W41147dd/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13W41147dd/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>人人都应该成为女权主义者</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>阿迪契 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Hs411S7Tm/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Hs411S7Tm/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.al